{"title":"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems\"> 2021 CMC 12A #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_10A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 10A Problems (page does not exist)\"> 2021 CMC 10A #5</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There exists a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/c/75c28a208ac8ad270be5d7ea934e4428cd3cab76.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\tfrac{1}{999}+\\tfrac{1}{1001}}{2}=\\frac{1}{1000}+\\frac{1}{N}.\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"41\" /> What is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06d60071dfe81246e5132e8d6ceb7e29ca473739.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 36\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 45\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 54\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 63\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 72\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/e/8becb83d37f49e4f7485ec5a53d66d441b6a4068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/0/940f8c20f3790c14c69ed497fb5686e75cd9e40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\tfrac{1}{a-1}+\\frac{1}{a+1}}{2}-\\frac{1}{a}=\\frac{1}{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"161\" height=\"42\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/3737e4e7298dae10328188f6ea52d0bfcecd397b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a^{3}-a}=\\frac{1}{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"96\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/f/01f0483fd3588a337054a74ab9bc4ff7270683b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=a^{3}-a=1000^{3}-1000=999,999,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"338\" height=\"18\" /> whose digits sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/3/733ade18b35b7f77e96ba8e2b5277cd661ec7762.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 54}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/H4uIpLB-6Jo\">https://youtu.be/H4uIpLB-6Jo</a>\n</p><p>~Punxsutawney Phil\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A\">2021 CMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=2021\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;